[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 SDP (Software Development Plan) - Military Quad Copter RTOS
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1. Scope
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.1 Identification
[REFERENCE]
TYPE: Document
REF: SRS.sdoc
DESC: See Software Requirements Specification for requirements.
[REFERENCE]
