[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS is developed for autonomous, secure, and real-time UAV operations in military environments.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for the development plan.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document is organized per MIL-STD-498, covering scope, referenced documents, required work, development activities, and notes.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports review and validation.
[[/SECTION]]
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 2. Referenced documents
[REFERENCE]
TYPE: Document
REF: SRS.sdoc
DESC: Software Requirements Specification
[REFERENCE]
TYPE: Document
REF: SDD.sdoc
DESC: Software Design Description
[REFERENCE]
TYPE: Document
REF: STP.sdoc
DESC: Software Test Plan
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 3. Overview of required work
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-003-MILUAV
TITLE: Required Work
STATEMENT: The project includes requirements analysis, design, implementation, integration, verification, validation, and deployment of the RTOS.
RATIONALE: Outlines the major work areas for the project.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 4. Plans for performing general software development activities
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-004-MILUAV
TITLE: Development Process
STATEMENT: The project will follow an iterative, model-based development process with continuous integration and verification.
RATIONALE: Ensures quality and traceability throughout development.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 5. Plans for performing detailed software development activities
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-005-MILUAV
TITLE: Detailed Activities
STATEMENT: Each phase (requirements, design, implementation, test) will include reviews, audits, and formal acceptance criteria.
RATIONALE: Ensures each activity meets quality standards.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 6. Plans for performing integral activities
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-006-MILUAV
TITLE: Integral Activities
STATEMENT: Configuration management, quality assurance, and risk management will be performed throughout the project lifecycle.
RATIONALE: Integral activities ensure project success and compliance.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 7. Plans for performing supporting activities
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-007-MILUAV
TITLE: Supporting Activities
STATEMENT: Training, documentation, and maintenance planning will be provided to support system deployment and sustainment.
RATIONALE: Supporting activities ensure long-term system viability.
[[/SECTION]]
[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 8. Notes
[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-008-MILUAV
TITLE: Notes
STATEMENT: All development activities will comply with MIL-STD-498 and related standards.
RATIONALE: Ensures compliance and traceability.
[[/SECTION]]
[[/SECTION]]
